Origin: DHI-internal (Kubernetes client compatibility)
Description: Emit WatchList initial-events-end BOOKMARK events so client-go
 v0.35+ reflectors (Kyverno reports-controller) can finish cache sync against
 the aggregated reports-server APIs. Without this, watches hang on
 "awaiting required bookmark event" and PolicyReports are never written.
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/kyverno/reports-server.git 7f1511eeb6b5f4a83bab914214b5dcd22d8d3e14
Verify: cmd `go test ./pkg/api -run '^TestReportWatchSendsInitialEventsAndBookmark$' -count=1` expect "ok"
Drop-When: never: remove after upstream resolves https://github.com/kyverno/reports-server/issues/360 and publishes the fix
Forwarded: https://github.com/kyverno/reports-server/issues/360
Upstream API: https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/using-api/api-concepts/#streaming-lists

